   Zhang, Han, East China Normal Univ, Sch Geog Sci, Minist Educ, Key Lab Geog Informat Sci, Shanghai 200241, Peoples R China.
   Yan, Yuchao, Peking Univ, Coll Urban \& Environm Sci, Sino French Inst Earth Syst Sci, Beijing 100871, Peoples R China.},
